# A missing page gets the site's own 404 page (templates/404.html) instead of
# Apache's plain "Not Found". Added 2026-11-14: the live site was serving the
# Apache default. Friends with Brews has had the same line in its
# static/.htaccess, and its live 404 uses its own page, so the server honours
# it there; that this site's host allows it too is expected, not yet seen.
# If the site ever answers 500 right after a deploy, this file is the first
# suspect: remove it and deploy again.
ErrorDocument 404 /404.html
